OL,3,GNEWSAFarm forced to cancel Christmas
OL,4,Aevent due to fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular family attraction that was
OL,7,Fdamaged by a fire at the weekend has
OL,8,Fbeen forced to cancel the upcoming
OL,9,FChristmas event it had spent six weeks
OL,10,Fpreparing for.
OL,12,FFirefighters were called to the blaze
OL,13,Fat Chobham Adventure Farm, near Woking
OL,14,Fin Surrey, just after 19:40 GMT on
OL,15,FSaturday. The site said no animals or
OL,16,Fpeople were hurt.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
