OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFarm forced to cancel Christmas
OL,4,Aevent due to fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwner Bean Chapman told BBC Radio
OL,7,FSurrey when he walked back into the
OL,8,Fsite after the fire he saw "a lot of
OL,9,Fdripping metal, a lot of charred ash"
OL,10,Fand that it was "a bit of a
OL,11,Fheartbreak".
OL,13,F"It's heart-wrenching because all that
OL,14,Feffort and work that you put into these
OL,15,Fthings, and it's just a charred mess on
OL,16,Fthe floor," he added.
